  "worked_solution": "To work out \n${(\\frac{1}{4})}^{2},$\n we multiply \n$\\frac{1}{4}$\n by itself:\n\n$$\n{(\\frac{1}{4})}^{2}=\\frac{1}{4}\\cdot \\frac{1}{4}=\\frac{1}{16}\n$$",
